From 3b8d79284cbb38d828b786fa0135ff0eecb46497 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 04:04:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(doctor-dashboard): add real charts + fix CS manager
 schedule permission

- DoctorDashboardStable: add personal daily sales trend (AreaChart) and
  avg-invoice comparison (BarChart, me vs branch avg vs top performer)
  to the overview tab, using the already-loaded sales analytics summary
  (one extra lightweight fetch for the doctor-scoped daily trend).
- Use a Trophy icon for the top-3 branch ranking instead of a plain number.
- permissionSystem.ts: customer_service_manager (CS_MANAGER_BASE) was
  missing view_schedule / view_shift_performance, so no per-account
  permission override could ever grant it access to /schedule or
  /shift-notes (capPermissionsToRole only allows toggling keys that
  already exist in the role's own preset). Added both keys so CS
  managers can see their own shift schedule and shift notes.
